    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c7eac00701f6c0e22f23b4f7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但就算立刻参赛“凯旋门赏”也毫无胜算。\n自己能为恩师做些什么？\n在她大受打击之时──",
      "source_fingerprint": "55278e9e263aeccc1944cb5d4296dbfb316b50c26fbfc9729a1af19ed6f457ed",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
