    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c895f5ed112237240ade46b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "中山庆典在记者面前做出宣告。人们须要\n看到希望，所以自己将在经典三冠展现实力，\n让人们看见足以迈向“凯旋门赏”的希望。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f2f97692c6067dd1f95a008a5e21ac9f8fed7bd72af8dcc577d8b1f56bc45973",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1049/storytimeline_501049418.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94ca1b3cdd20f992982f2b84",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1049/storytimeline_501049418.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c776a37aaa402c3393a83fd6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而记者们批评她不自量力，\n说她的才气比不上曾前进世界的神鹰。\n然而──她的决心并未因此动摇。",
      "source_fingerprint": "57a923ec2c2117e53908405b9286d1a5f0909b33d75101d681180040957059ca",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1049/storytimeline_501049418.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:43456092ae80c45167326ebc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1049/storytimeline_501049418.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f8b80d30f3e2065d2ffaf2aa",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "即使四周无人看好，她仍要闯荡三冠路线──\n要在“日本德比”让所有人看见希望。\n因她早已决定要为他人带来希望。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b0b7f9df2dc2ef4847661e9c4b68603d7d3becf4983afc38a5f83a9b9dfdedb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1049/storytimeline_501049418.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:53eac7721c4daff32fe8ab1f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "皋月赏结束后・是谁陷入了幻影",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c4c600ae37002bbdb5874e10a4cba7cbc9b95a5508b6ee81cfc52374ed1d66a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1049/storytimeline_501049418.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ceec1241d7c22fec00af466d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "中山庆典跑出了优异表现。\n然而──观众跟记者们\n却只顾讨论“橡树大赛”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b079c507e6dd3b829cbc522bc2c4dcd752e3490e04ae4f17652d0ed5ac79644",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1049/storytimeline_501049419.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:efd698bdaf5b2a83eb745ca3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "众人的对话传进中山庆典耳里。\n她深深感受到纵然在“日本德比”大放异彩，\n仍尚未受到认可成为希望之星。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a56f9f0d03148a854e420ce8258795560ed472a6f028a3e9bc0ee99209eb838",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1049/storytimeline_501049419.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:82826ab969b8ab639988c80d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "凭现在的自己真的有办法帮助别人\n燃起希望吗？她激励自己再度振奋，\n发誓将在“菊花赏”展现货真价实的实力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2dbe2922f2a91407c372c485e2c5454003deb6c25821577a6877e6d09b5647a6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1049/storytimeline_501049419.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:204894b154580f23bbb32b0a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "──赶在病魔击溃一切希望之前。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3863e513810f7b9c8a46e2902378ddb392aa3d9ac06203b366cd32a5b52592c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1049/storytimeline_501049419.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a90866fc20cd2609ce19283c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "日本德比结束后・真正的实力才能留下",
      "source_fingerprint": "15b3fb9f670ddd8b79bfb37f93e7aca7bea83e866a1b1b1369b8e42e87273236",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1049/storytimeline_501049419.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad4002007f0fb91f3f3a9fb2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1049/storytimeline_501049420.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1815fdbcb67f594610c904e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "中山庆典倾注一切跑完比赛。\n这场比赛是否为老师带来了希望？\n她满心期待。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e8109ada0e02f93132dbe8e5ada6f29d2affbaf728fa7cbcd8bd374f75ab32df",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1049/storytimeline_501049420.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d92f27f28d0ebe0d62f3bfc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1049/storytimeline_501049420.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:113a2312c045d5d8207b7004",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然而映入眼帘的是残酷的现实。\n病房里的恩师身型日渐削瘦、声音沙哑──\n她怀疑起自己的所作所为是否真的有意义。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8eae33ccd1216f18e020e2ca1d875755e49c9cd46db2eebceed75e8914c012bd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1049/storytimeline_501049420.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:674da993386717d3184b98c6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1049/storytimeline_501049420.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c2cedf455a0121cc0edf0099",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "中山庆典觉得自己至今的行动\n根本无法带来希望，\n此时东瀛佐敦出现在她面前。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc389cad5d72bd6dac8d33b678b9e630fc07c29aa41b187838d31fc7ff68006d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1049/storytimeline_501049420.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:531a6b94d939784584cfe3e3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1049/storytimeline_501049420.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:675cc3980555c93b1008ca76",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她说自己正是看到中山庆典的跑姿\n才燃起希望想“活下去”，并提出邀约\n在“中日报杯”一决胜负。",
      "source_fingerprint": "653533583411ea83516aa9ea4d13477b8e5b757b768c8234a41977a30625e3e0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1049/storytimeline_501049420.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:60d44caa79c2b6c375be8516",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1049/storytimeline_501049420.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a044d5af251a51884a62e7b4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "自己的行动真的能够改变他人命运。\n看见希望的中山庆典再次振奋，\n迈向接下来的挑战“中日报杯”──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a8d7e3a8257a6abdea7287b0a23392dc3f2ec8bf726c0c341c5e76be1068f17a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
