      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "日本总大将落败了。\n中山庆典举起胜利的旗帜，\n向神鹰发出战帖。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c83dfd7c77efc3b999d937a43853dd27887b2a03478afea976a1c6743445938",
